{"id":2759,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>12月30日，我院韩秀兰老师在15103Z教室面向全体研三同学，开展题为“论文写作规范提升——生成式人工智能在学位论文写作中的正确运用”专题讲座。</p><p>韩老师首先明确“辅助工具而非替代手段”的核心原则，强调AI不能替代学生的独立思考；接着，她系统介绍AI在文献梳理、框架搭建、数据处理和语言润色等场景中的合理运用，并提醒学生必须对生成内容进行深度加工与验证，以避免学术不端；最后，针对过度依赖与使用痕迹过重等问题，韩老师通过实例演示如何在各环节规范使用AI，切实提升论文质量。</p><p>本次讲座紧密结合研三同学的实际需求，回应了人工智能背景下学术写作的新挑战，提供了兼具规范性、实操性的解决方案，为同学们高质量完成学位论文、恪守学术诚信奠定扎实基础。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMRLLaUNMfnz-bLMNU8L8VfozG4nlCoPMmVRMNlaM4L4Lz-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hVMSh2n1yanmGPUz-snRV7LRnfLl7YM7-YM7rRUmLbolWFUNVkUzGPolVFLlWRM4UJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDLm7igtA8pUucc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6215&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6E5FF0F01A27D1D04A1A24B24ECB399B/BABA019A/1BC74\" vheight=\"233.27000427246094\" vwidth=\"311.1300048828125\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMRLLaUNMfnz-bLMNU8L8VfozG4nlCoPMmVRMNlaM4L4Lz-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hVMSh2n1yanmGPUz-snRV7LRnfLl7YM7-YM7rRUmLbolWFUNVkUzGPolVFLlWRM4UJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDLm7igtA8pUucc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6215&e=.jpeg\"></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMRLLaUNMfnz-bLMNU8L8VfozG4nlCoPMmVRMNlaM4L4Lz-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hVMSh2n1yanmGPUz-snRV7LRnfLl7YM7-YM7rRUmLbolWFUNVkUzGPolVFLlWRM4UJqjfTQ4Oeo4xxC5WZq5MxgDTJQty0LzGaL1yDLm7igtA8pUucc&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6215&e=.jpeg"}